 figure out be specific who  do you want to help second thing is do  you want to be an entrepreneur or you  want to just have a career and there's  nothing wrong with having a career that  fulfills you that makes you happy that  gives you your passion you don't have to  be an entrepreneur as much as I love  entrepreneurs and helping people become  their own business owner it doesn't have  to be that way you know if you don't  have the  set to be an entrepreneur don't be an  entrepreneur I have the zuga mindset  test that helps people figure out if  they're meant to be an entrepreneur now  if you have that right mindset and if  it's not for you that's great like it's  good to know that you can get whatever  fulfillment you have potentially from a  career if you're not meant to be an  entrepreneur so you think about helping  people so you know do you want to be a  guidance counselor do you want to be a  marriage counselor do you want to be a  psychologist right there's tons of  opportunities there are tons of  traditional paths that you can take  without having a launch your own company  that might make you feel passionate so  you got to figure out do you want a  career you want to fit into the  structure in the system or do you want  to launch your own company there's two  different paths and the third thing is  get started okay you don't need to go  quit your job and have you know no  income coming in and and you know burn  the boats and go and try this new thing  start part-time start small you know if  you don't know who you want to help just  start either volunteering get a  part-time job  help people on the side but explore do  something every week that you're  spending some time to explore yourself  explore your passion and see who you  really love helping out it may be  volunteering part-time at a school and  being a part-time guidance counselor or  helping some people probably know  volunteering again or taking a part-time  job at a psychology you know with a with  a psychologist who's helping people work  through their issues right starts  because you're learning and there's  gonna be some opportunities that you go  to and you'll be you know like you know  that's great but it's not really for me  and there'll be one that you go to and  just think wow I want to do this I want  to do this more and and that's when you  know that you found your passion right  that's you know you want to be like that  person you want to be in this industry  and it could be as a job or it could be  starting your own company but when you  experience it you get that feeling that  makes you come alive you know you've got  to keep doing this you look at famous  entrepreneurs you look at how they got  started you look at why they got started  because they got that hot  right they love what they do it's not  just about making money they truly  deeply passionately love what they do so  you've got to find that you got to find  what it is that gets you so excited and  it comes from trying so don't that this  is a great start being frustrated with  your current work having a general sense  of where you want to go that's a great  start the difference so here is you need  to act and act part-time small-scale but  consistently something every single week  that you are doing to explore this  passion of yours until you find the  thing that makes you come alive and say  I need to go do this when you find that  then you know you're on the right path  believe for those of you watching I'd  love to hear what you have to think let  me know how you've broken out of the  nine-to-five job or how you found your  passion leave it in the comments below  I'd love to hear your story because it  will help inspire the people as well  give it a thumbs up if you liked this  video it makes you want to do more for  you and click on my face to subscribe to  the channel see more videos like this  thank you so much let's see you soon
 

